  "description": "Dachshund Seamless Pattern | Sweater Dog Digital Paper | Cute Sausage Dog Repeat Design | Plaid Wallpaper | Fabric Print\nWHAT YOU WILL RECEIVE\n1 Seamless Pattern Design\nHigh Resolution 4096 x 4096 px\nPNG Format\nSeamless Repeating Tile\nInstant Digital Download\nAdd cozy cottage charm to your creative projects with this Dachshund Seamless Pattern. Featuring adorable sausage dogs dressed in colorful sweaters and surrounded by delicate spring tulips, this whimsical design combines playful illustration with timeless countryside appeal.\nThe pattern showcases lovable dachshunds in a variety of charming poses, including standing, sitting, resting, and lounging. Each dog wears a unique outfit, from blue and white striped sweaters to orange polka dot shirts, pink floral knits, and classic green argyle sweaters, giving every puppy its own delightful personality. Delicate pink and yellow tulips bloom throughout the composition, while tiny black dots add subtle texture. The soft light green plaid background creates a fresh, cozy setting that perfectly complements the cheerful color palette.\nInspired by cottagecore aesthetics, children’s book illustrations, vintage textiles, country gardens, pet-themed artwork, and Scandinavian-inspired surface design, this pattern blends warmth, personality, and timeless charm. The harmonious pastel palette and playful details make it suitable for both children’s collections and sophisticated pet-themed products.\nIts versatile dog theme makes it ideal for fabric printing, wallpaper design, stationery collections, planners, journals, scrapbook papers, wrapping paper, packaging projects, branding materials, and print-on-demand products. The seamless repeat ensures professional-quality results across a wide variety of creative applications.\nPerfect for dog lovers, nursery décor, children’s products, greeting cards, notebooks, gift wrap, boutique branding, home décor, pet accessories, and surface pattern design portfolios, this dachshund pattern brings warmth, joy, and countryside charm to every creative project.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Dachshund Seamless Pattern | Sweater Dog Digital Paper | Cute Sausage Dog Repeat Design | Plaid Wallpaper | Fabric Print</p>\n<p>WHAT YOU WILL RECEIVE<br>\n1 Seamless Pattern Design<br>\nHigh Resolution 4096 x 4096 px<br>\nPNG Format<br>\nSeamless Repeating Tile<br>\nInstant Digital Download</p>\n<p>Add cozy cottage charm to your creative projects with this Dachshund Seamless Pattern. Featuring adorable sausage dogs dressed in colorful sweaters and surrounded by delicate spring tulips, this whimsical design combines playful illustration with timeless countryside appeal.</p>\n<p>The pattern showcases lovable dachshunds in a variety of charming poses, including standing, sitting, resting, and lounging. Each dog wears a unique outfit, from blue and white striped sweaters to orange polka dot shirts, pink floral knits, and classic green argyle sweaters, giving every puppy its own delightful personality. Delicate pink and yellow tulips bloom throughout the composition, while tiny black dots add subtle texture. The soft light green plaid background creates a fresh, cozy setting that perfectly complements the cheerful color palette.</p>\n<p>Inspired by cottagecore aesthetics, children’s book illustrations, vintage textiles, country gardens, pet-themed artwork, and Scandinavian-inspired surface design, this pattern blends warmth, personality, and timeless charm. The harmonious pastel palette and playful details make it suitable for both children’s collections and sophisticated pet-themed products.</p>\n<p>Its versatile dog theme makes it ideal for fabric printing, wallpaper design, stationery collections, planners, journals, scrapbook papers, wrapping paper, packaging projects, branding materials, and print-on-demand products. The seamless repeat ensures professional-quality results across a wide variety of creative applications.</p>\n<p>Perfect for dog lovers, nursery décor, children’s products, greeting cards, notebooks, gift wrap, boutique branding, home décor, pet accessories, and surface pattern design portfolios, this dachshund pattern brings warmth, joy, and countryside charm to every creative project.</p>",
